なタイプ。他人が議論するとストレスを感じ、心の中で静かに愚痴をこぼす。\nこの作品も似たような雰囲気になったらすごいな！\nhttps://x.com/mochanimalinari/status/1945773873569714574\nご検討ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://mire-larkspur-87e.notion.site/kg", "nc": 136, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mochanimalinari/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3691614, "client_id": 879717, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9af8e794/uploads/origins/bd023e5c-ecf1-4fee-a214-3039be389a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c6a896a90f5d36463fcc8a61cec67f3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9af8e794/uploads/origins/bd023e5c-ecf1-4fee-a214-3039be389a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ca18882f00d8fd4f0ddbf2369216ded5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "もちもちアニマル開設ありがとうございます！\n稲荷さんの貂ちゃんとうすな様が好きなので、\n夏が暑くて横たわってる2体かプール遊びしてる2体が見たいです。\nよろしくお願い致します。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1628332, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "まさゆみ", "screen_name": "msym_1230", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1798678604018307072/baVogwKQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/750144507656548353/1692396220/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "art"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 2157615, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "怒武ねずみ", "screen_name": "norvegicusrat", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fme